{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"gothic rock\" (+ \"social commentary\" society social political) (+ lyrics themes))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_17_1885571310#13_2033459769","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2347","rank":3,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_17_1885571310#13_2033459769\" , \"end_char\": 8334.000000 , \"headings\": \"Immigrant Song Immigrant Song From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia Contents Background Composition and <cover>lyrics Releases Reception Live performances Use of the song in media Chart history Original release Digital download Certifications See also References External links \" , \"segment\": \"p. 76. ISBN 978-1-55022-530-3. The first Viking metal song ever, Immigrant Song might also be the first smudge of gothic rock evidenced by Plant's exotic pre-Dio vocal melodies which turn an almost casual, incidental song into a quickly attacking then evaporating classic. ^ Curtis, James M. (1987). Rock Eras: Interpretations of Music and Society, </cover>1954–1984. Popular Press. p. 292. ISBN 978-0-87972-369-9. ^ a b Erlewine, Stephen Thomas. \"\" , \"start_char\": 7894.000000 , \"title\": \"Immigrant Song - Wikipedia\" , \"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Immigrant_Song\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_10_740905030#13_1377008089","rank":1,"relevance":2},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_10_740905030#12_1377006024","rank":2,"relevance":2}]}}
