{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"goth rock\" (+ themes lyrical lyrics) (+ death religion love alienation society))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_36_1595724340#2_3301623748","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2354","rank":1,"snippet":"make me feel like I am whole again” Darkness ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Passion ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Lyrics ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Originality ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Story ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Magic ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Fun Facts! Country Countdown! Marloes Valentina Stella \" , \"segment\": \"This list is thus not limited to goth artists or <cover>goth rock alone; it also features gothic metal and mixed or related genres (doom/symphonic/black). There are even a few songs made by pop artists. What makes a Good Gothic Love Song? So, what are the components of a good gothic love song? I named 6 factors that I believe are often present in a good gothic music: 1) darkness, the ‘goth feel’; 2) passion, including fatal love; 3) lyrics, </cover>preferably well-written and poetic; 4) originality, uniqueness;\" , \"start_char\": 1565.000000 , \"title\": \"Top 25 Best Gothic Love Songs of All Time - Council of the Lost\" , \"url\": \"https://www.councilofthelost.com/2019/11/28/best-gothic-love-songs-of-all-time/\" }"}}
