{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_37_1376167889#3_3046473942","relevance":2,"reason":"The page is a comparison of emo and goth rather than a document dedicated to goth rock, but it does provide partial supporting evidence by stating that gothic rock expresses emotional themes and associates goth with introversion, seclusion, depression, self-injury, and suicide.","learned":"A comparison source loosely connects gothic rock/goth with emotional expression, introversion, seclusion, depression, self-injury, and suicide, but it is not a strong dedicated source."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"gothic rock\" (+ \"societal decay\" alienation despair oppression) (+ lyrics themes))","reason":"Search for direct evidence that gothic rock addressed social alienation or societal decay, using more issue-focused terminology while requiring gothic rock and lyrics/themes."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"gothic rock\" (+ \"societal decay\" alienation despair oppression) (+ lyrics themes))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_01_658303099#9_635985778","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2357","rank":2,"snippet":"song and the way it makes me feel now. It’s about them, it’s about my relationship with our fans over the years. Composition \"My Immortal\" is a piano rock and <cover>gothic rock ballad written in the key of A major. According to the sheet music published by Alfred Music Publishing on the website Musicnotes.com, the song is set in common time and performed in slow and free tempo of 80 beats per minute. Lee's vocal range for the song runs from the musical note of A 3 to C ♯ 5. The lyrics of the song refer to a spirit that haunts the memory of a grieving loved one. In \"My Immortal\", Lee expresses her feelings through the line, \"Though you're still with me / I've been alone all along.\" The song was described as a \"goth-meets pop\" song along with \"Bring Me to Life\" and \"Going Under\". A writer for IGN said that \"'My Immortal' is a song of pain and despair </cover>caused by the loss of a family member or very close friend and how it drove her [Lee] to the edge of insanity.\"\" , \"start_char\": 6037.","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_17_237360052#8_262516369","rank":1,"relevance":1}]}}
