{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_17_22690810#8_25544592","relevance":2,"reason":"The document is about deathrock, not gothic rock as the main topic, but it directly states that the style that became gothic rock/positive punk combined moody instrumentation with romantic and morbid themes.","learned":"An adjacent deathrock source again supports that early gothic rock addressed romantic and morbid themes."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"goth rock\" (+ history characteristics genre) (+ lyrics melancholy morbid romantic death))","reason":"Search for goth-rock-specific history or characteristics pages that directly summarize the genre's lyrical themes, with terms that have produced useful evidence while avoiding overly broad metal/deathrock matches."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"goth rock\" (+ history characteristics genre) (+ lyrics melancholy morbid romantic death))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_01_1346695066#5_1842369031","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2376","rank":3,"snippet":", \"headings\": \"History and Styles of Heavy Metal History and Styles of Heavy Metal Exploring the subgenres History Musical and Vocal Styles Genres The Future \" , \"segment\": \"Examples: Cruachan, Geasa, Waylander Death Metal An extreme form of the genre that uses distorted guitars and a growling vocal style sometimes described as \\\"cookie monster\\\" vocals. Examples: Cannibal Corpse, Death, Deicide, Morbid Angel Doom Metal A genre that uses slower tempos and emphasizes gloomy, melancholy and atmospheric music. There are numerous subgenres of doom, including drone, epic, industrial, sludge, and stoner. Examples: Candlemass, Pentagram, Saint Vitus, Solstice Gothic Metal A combination of the darkness and melancholy of <cover>goth rock with heavy metal. The lyrics tend to be epic and melodramatic. This is a genre </cover>that uses a lot of male/female vocal combinations with the male vocalist generally using more aggressive vocals and the female singing in an ethereal soprano. Examples:\" , \"start_char\": 2922.000000 , \"title\": \"History, Styles and Subgenres of Heavy Metal\" , \"url\": \"http://heavymetal.about.com/od/motorhead/p/motorhead.htm\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_58_5379274#5_5949515","rank":1,"relevance":2},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_01_1346695066#6_1842370242","rank":2,"relevance":1}]}}
