{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_17_1236764777#7_1363372733","relevance":1,"reason":"The result is about gothic metal, not goth/gothic rock. It only says gothic metal's darker or melodramatic lyrics draw influence from gothic rock, then discusses suicide, meaninglessness, depression, and horror themes in gothic metal bands.","learned":"Gothic metal pages may link suicide, meaninglessness, depression, pain, deceit, and transgression to gothic-metal lyrics, but they remain indirect for goth rock."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"goth rock\" (+ \"deals with\" \"lyrics\" \"lyrical\") (+ alienation despair nihilism death religion sexuality))","reason":"Search the exact goth-rock label with explicit dealing/lyrical wording and candidate social-existential issues, aiming for direct genre-level evidence rather than gothic metal pages."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"goth rock\" (+ \"deals with\" \"lyrics\" \"lyrical\") (+ alienation despair nihilism death religion sexuality))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_28_970349970#30_2058894283","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2379","rank":1,"snippet":"80 Doom Metal in the ‘90s Metal concerts are known for being high energy. Best Heavy Metal Bands of the ‘90s #81—100 Gothic Metal in the ‘90s Heavy metal fashion revolves around dark colors. Other Notable Heavy Metal Bands of the ‘90s Groove Metal in the ‘90s \" , \"segment\": \"This style of music combined traditional heavy metal with dark atmospheric gothic rock influences. This form of music evolved out of the death-doom movement, which was a fusion of <cover>death metal and doom metal. This genre stands out for its use of confessional and introspective lyrics, often centered around gothic fiction. This blending of heavy metal and goth rock </cover>can still be heard in the compositions of more symphonic metal bands. Certain gothic metal acts relied on a \"beauty and the beast\" singing style, in which the male vocalist showcases an aggressive singing style while the female vocalist exhibits a clean singing style that's meant as a point of contrast. Classically trained female vocalists became the preferred choice by symphonic metal bands in the 2000s. pinterest-pin-it Heavy metal fashion revolves around dark colors. Wikipedia Commons Other Notable Heavy Metal Bands of "}}
